  "notes": "tm_397b_scanned_s1 and tm_480b_scanned_conv are kept to record that a scanned to_maxtext conversion of these checkpoints does not fit one tpu7x host (all shards must be staged; see benchmark_ckpt_load_time.py run_worker_to_maxtext_step1_hf_to_gcs), so they have no 2-slice load task. st_397b_scanned_s4 adds a 4-slice point for qwen3.5-397b-a17b scanned, whose 2-slice transform runs out of HBM in the composite (wi_0, wi_1) split even with patches/hbmfix. p2_llama70b_scanned_s2_tm re-runs the llama3.1-70b scanned 2-slice Orbax load with checkpoint_storage_concurrent_gb=38 (20 GB was smaller than its 37.58 GB leaf); it needs a pod with the per-task harness sync, hence the stagefix tree. p2_rerun_scanned_s1_outliers repeats safetensors_dynamic scanned on 1 slice for qwen3-14b and qwen3-32b (transform 298 s and 304 s vs 51-53 s on 2 slices) into run tpu7x_16m_rerun. p2_gptoss120b_unscanned_st runs gpt-oss-120b safetensors_dynamic unscanned on 1 and 2 slices, which the harness skipped after the scanned runs ran out of HBM (jit temporaries of 200 GB / 100 GB per device)."
